comment0.text=\r\n Enumeration that defines the types of pre-configured demonstration scenarios \r\n for the simulation. Each type specifies the number of bikes, stations, \r\n and docks to be created.\r\n * @author DP classes\r\n @version 2025.20.10\r\n
